{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious witch rescued you from a coma in the Demon Forest, only to teach you how to run a tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to teleport you and the tavern to a strange town, she was willing to let herself vanish into thin air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Tranquilizing Honey Wine, which can free witches from their nightmares, your tavern quickly becomes bustling with business. So you start recruiting staff, decorating the tavern, purchasing ingredients, developing dishes, making friends... and exploring this fun-filled world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But please don't forget to find the answer: who is the witch who saved you? What exactly happened before you fell into a coma?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/b89eceab23de39fdef37e782530f46d2.avif?t=1762944493\" width=520 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ab5dcfeb4644dcc0a22790a3f6407e73.poster.avif?t=1762944493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ab5dcfeb4644dcc0a22790a3f6407e73.webm?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/ab5dcfeb4644dcc0a22790a3f6407e73.mp4?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right, how can an interesting world be without fishing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of fish live in the waters of Padua town? Will the dishes made be delicious or will they scare away customers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a desired location, put on special bait, wave your fishing rod, and elegantly, calmly, and fully concentrate on catching that big fish\uff08\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f\uff09!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/62ad6802f9aa776b38934fdd194db149.avif?t=1762944493\" width=520 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/588a397874224925ff42d68292ace12e.poster.avif?t=1762944493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/588a397874224925ff42d68292ace12e.webm?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/588a397874224925ff42d68292ace12e.mp4?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to running a tavern, you stroll around the small town of Padua and accidentally enter the 'Tide Jewelry Store' during low tide. Various rare magical accessories are displayed in the store, and violets emit a faint light... In addition, you also noticed that the owner is a black cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Do humans like these shiny treasures collected by me Meow\uff1f&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/bf09fe9aeb840df679eef444406b7a24.avif?t=1762944493\" width=520 height=173 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/f818e2b2e6377fa526b11f98701377d7.poster.avif?t=1762944493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/f818e2b2e6377fa526b11f98701377d7.webm?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/f818e2b2e6377fa526b11f98701377d7.mp4?t=1762944493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireball technique! Thunderblasting technique! Summon our great Creator\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop! Do we only need magic for wilderness adventures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not use magic to water plants directly in Padua's peaceful daily routine (at least for the most part)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, please don't wet yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/6aea2725aa1dbf1365442f6d484119da.avif?t=1762944493\" width=520 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/79248ae9671276c7c3e2229ceab183f2.avif?t=1762944493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/79248ae9671276c7c3e2229ceab183f2.webp?t=1762944493 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras/90e7be12ee7a0b3e2a4ce329cdd75f0a.avif?t=1762944493\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979290/extras_big/90e7be12ee7a0b3e2a4ce329cdd75f0a.webp?t=1